Data sources
  - GitHub /meta endpoint (https://api.github.com/meta): published GitHub Actions and service CIDR ranges,
    used to match observed network addresses to cloud regions. IP addresses are never stored.
  - Azure service tags, AWS ip-ranges.json and GitHub /meta, used to curate collector/data/region-cidrs.json
    (region CIDR table; see SPEC 3.4).
  - Azure and AWS region names and city-level coordinates in aggregator/data/region-coords.json are
    curated from the providers' public region information.
  - Cloudflare trace endpoint (https://1.1.1.1/cdn-cgi/trace): read in memory for the egress IP when the
    Azure instance metadata service is unreachable (D-011). The IP is never stored.
